The Sinhastha Mela Sanitation Rules, 1992
(ix)
neglecting the fencing of any well, tank or other dangerous place or structure;
(x)
washing cattles in the Kshipra river from Railway bridge to Barnagar causeway and from Bherogarh bridge to
Mangalnalh Ghat;
(xi)
obstructing or not giving co-operation in the preventive measures regarding health and sanitation.
